WEBVTT

00:00:00.116 --> 00:00:04.796
This video shows how to mark daily transport attendance on a phone.

00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:13.029
Tap the menu button, open Transport and choose Attendance. The date is set to today.

00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:26.397
Tap the route box and choose the route. Its students appear as cards, and the totals at the top show everyone as Boarded.

00:00:33.931 --> 00:00:45.715
On the first student card tap Not Boarded, for someone who missed the bus. On the second card tap Absent, for someone who stayed home. The totals change as you tap.

00:01:12.106 --> 00:01:21.634
Scroll back up and tap Save All. A message confirms how many students were saved, and the totals show one Not Boarded and one Absent.

00:01:39.518 --> 00:01:44.534
Attendance is saved for the route, and the totals for the day are on the screen.
